                "text": "Republicans have health care solutions that empower individuals. There are real reforms \u2014 like expanding HSAs and CHOICE Arrangement accounts \u2014 that can lower costs for millions of Americans. \n\nThe so-called \u201cAffordable Care Act\u201d drove premiums higher, and the Democrats\u2019 latest proposal simply kicks the can down the road.\n\nIt\u2019s time for policies that strengthen competition, expand choice, and put patients at the center of health care.",
